patch.description:
The request allows users to change the status of the card token. Allowed token status values: 
ACTIVE value can be used only to resume card while it is in status SUSPENDED;
SUSPENDED value can be used only while token is in status ACTIVE to temporary suspend token from usage;
DEACTIVATED value is equivalent to permanent token delete. May be used only on tokens with original status of ACTIVE or SUSPENDED. This status change can't be reversed.
Other available token statuses are not allowed to be used in this endpoint.
